flowchart TD
  Q[Uncertain situation] --> A{Authority clear?}
  A -->|no| R[Refuse fail closed]
  A -->|yes| B{Known Op / meta?}
  B -->|unknown meta| I[Ignore]
  B -->|unknown Op| P[Profile policy]
  B -->|known| C{Peer can apply?}
  C -->|no| L[Lower to Baseline Ops]
  C -->|yes| Apply[Peer apply]
  Apply --> D{Activity end or revoke?}
  D -->|yes| Rev[Reverse lineage]
  Rev --> E{Reverse complete?}
  E -->|no| M[Mark non-reversible]
  E -->|yes| OK[Done]
